  "status": "present",
  "value": "lines is a list of strings, target is a non-empty string and linesAround >= 0. A line matches when target occurs in it as a case-sensitive substring. Line i is included when some matching line j satisfies |i - j| <= linesAround. Return the included lines, verbatim, in their original order, each line position at most once (equal lines at different positions are separate entries).",
